    Menu <|-- StartupMenu : inheritance – hierarchical
    Menu <|-- MainMenu : inheritance – hierarchical
    Menu <|-- CustomerMenu : inheritance – hierarchical
    Menu <|-- CaptainMenu : inheritance – hierarchical
    Menu <|-- OperationsMenu : inheritance – hierarchical
    Menu <|-- ClockMenu : inheritance – hierarchical
    QuitRequested <|-- EndOfInput : inheritance – EndOfInput IS-A QuitRequested

    Menu "0..*" o-- "1" ConsoleIO : aggregation – one ConsoleIO shared by all menus
    MainMenu "1" *-- "4" Menu : composition – builds its sub-menus, holds them as Menu (polymorphism)
    MainMenu o-- CliSession : aggregation – shared session
    CustomerMenu o-- CliSession : aggregation – shared session
    CaptainMenu o-- CliSession : aggregation – shared session
    OperationsMenu o-- CliSession : aggregation – shared session
    ClockMenu o-- CliSession : aggregation – shared session
    CliSession "1" *-- "1" ChennaiRideApp : composition – same seeded world as the demo
    CliSession o-- ConsoleIO : aggregation – shared
    CustomerMenu --> "0..1" Customer : association – selected customer
    CaptainMenu --> "0..1" Captain : association – selected captain
    StartupMenu ..> CliSession : dependency – starts a fresh session
    StartupMenu ..> MainMenu : dependency – runs it
    ConsoleIO ..> GoBack : dependency – raises on b
    ConsoleIO ..> QuitRequested : dependency – raises on q
    ConsoleIO ..> EndOfInput : dependency – raises at end of input

    note for Menu "run() is written once here (template method):<br>show options, read a choice, call handle(), repeat.<br>Every RideHailingError is caught and printed as a clean message."

